  "details": "For the sake of comfort and fitting smaller avatars, populating the VRChat menu should result in it doing so straight and at the user's eye level. \nLooking down at the existing menu's angle isn't always a solution in certain situations. For some, that can also come at the cost of additional neck pain (ex: disabled users, those with injuries, etc).\nThank you for considering this request.",
